  "verseCount": 13,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DAN 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And at that time shall Michael stand up, the great prince which standeth for the children of thy people: and there shall be a time of trouble, such as never was since there was a nation",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.12.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.12.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to that same time: and at that time thy people shall be delivered, every one that shall be found written in the book.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And many of them that sleep in the dust of the earth shall awake, some to everlasting life, and some to shame",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.12.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.12.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "everlasting contempt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they that be wise shall shine as the brightness of the firmament; and they that turn many to righteousness as the stars for ever and ever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But thou, O Daniel, shut up the words, and seal the book,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.12.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.12.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to the time of the end: many shall run to and fro, and knowledge shall be increased.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Then I Daniel looked, and, behold, there stood other two, the one on this side of the bank of the river, and the other on that side of the bank of the river.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "one",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.12.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.12.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to the man clothed in linen, which",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.12.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.12.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upon the waters of the river, How long",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall it be to",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.12.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.12.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the end of these wonders?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I heard the man clothed in linen, which",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.12.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.12.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upon the waters of the river, when he held up his right hand and his left hand unto heaven, and sware by him that liveth for ever that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.12.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.12.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for a time, times, and an half; and when he shall have accomplished to scatter the power of the holy people, all these",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.12.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.12.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be finished.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I heard, but I understood not: then said I, O my Lord, what",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.12.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.12.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the end of these",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.12.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.12.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said, Go thy way, Daniel: for the words",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.12.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.12.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "closed up and sealed till the time of the end.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Many shall be purified, and made white, and tried; but the wicked shall do wickedly: and none of the wicked shall understand; but the wise shall understand.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And from the time",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.12.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.12.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the daily",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "sacrifice",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.12.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.12.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be taken away, and the abomination that maketh desolate set up,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.12.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.12.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a thousand two hundred and ninety days.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Blessed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.12.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.12.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he that waiteth, and cometh to the thousand three hundred and five and thirty days.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But go thou thy way till the end",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DAN.12.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DAN.12.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for thou shalt rest, and stand in thy lot at the end of the days.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
